      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Although I'm a world creator myself, and I usually try to keep interaction range \"Sane\". I do agree with the idea of this suggestion.\nThere should be a way for VR (and by extension desktop) users to enable/disable (certain) interactions or override/change the interaction range.",
